{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A sound journey among dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this Mesoamerican metroidvania. The <i>Plus Ultra: Legado</i> soundtrack transports you to a dreamlike world where pre-Hispanic sounds and Renaissance and Baroque melodies come together. Our music not only showcases our interest in creating an immersive video game atmosphere but also expresses the history of cultural blending. It features melodies from both sides of the Atlantic, arrangements based on period music and original compositions, as well as choirs in different languages, such as Nahuatl or Galician-Portuguese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Music by Javier Belmer &amp; Juan Haering</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949110?t=1764264892","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949110?t=1764264892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949110/21ae4e10f1c4ce2fddb3e4d579fe8438e3d54e4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764264892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949110/21ae4e10f1c4ce2fddb3e4d579fe8438e3d54e4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764264892","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A sound journey among dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in this Mesoamerican metroidvania. The <i>Plus Ultra: Legado</i> soundtrack transports you to a dreamlike world where pre-Hispanic sounds and Renaissance and Baroque melodies come together. Our music not only showcases our interest in creating an immersive video game atmosphere but also expresses the history of cultural blending. It features melodies from both sides of the Atlantic, arrangements based on period music and original compositions, as well as choirs in different languages, such as Nahuatl or Galician-Port